# Omega Runtime API INTERNAL list: names a manifest header declares that are NOT part of the API.
# tools/runtime_api_check.sh fails on any function, object-like macro or enumerator in a manifest header that is
# neither a manifest `fn`/`const` nor listed here with a reason, on a stale line here (no header declares the name)
# and on a name that is both here and in the manifest. Line format: `fn NAME # reason` or `const NAME # reason`.
# An entry here may change or vanish in any version. Making one API = move it to the manifest with a tier tag
# (and bump MINOR, docs/runtime/API.md section 2). Entries marked "candidate EXPERIMENTAL" are used outside tests today.
